{"page":433,"verses":[{"verse_key":"34:40","surah":34,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ يَحْشُرُهُمْ جَمِيعًا ثُمَّ يَقُولُ لِلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ إِيَّاكُمْ كَانُوا۟ يَعْبُدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day He gathers them all together, He will say to the angels, ‘Was it you these people worshipped?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"He will gather them","transliteration":"yaḥshuruhum","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"He will say","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","en_gloss":"to the Angels","transliteration":"lil'malāikati","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"Were these you","transliteration":"ahāulāi","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِيَّاكُمْ","en_gloss":"Were these you","transliteration":"iyyākum","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"worshipping","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","verse_key":"34:40"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:40"}]},{"verse_key":"34:41","surah":34,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ سُبْحَـٰنَكَ أَنتَ وَلِيُّنَا مِن دُونِهِم ۖ بَلْ كَانُوا۟ يَعْبُدُونَ ٱلْجِنَّ ۖ أَكْثَرُهُم بِهِم مُّؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will reply, ‘May You be exalted! You are our supporter against them! Really, they worshipped the jinn- most of them believed in them.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They will say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"34:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَكَ","en_gloss":"Glory be to You","transliteration":"sub'ḥānaka","verse_key":"34:4